{"id":"profundamente","lemma":"profundamente","pos":"adv","rank":2335,"glosses":["deeply (to a deep extent)","deeply (in a deep way)","profoundly (with depth; meaninfully)"],"ipa":"/pɾoˌfũ.daˈmẽ.t͡ʃi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/6/69/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-profundamente.wav/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Santamarcanda-profundamente.wav.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Eu estou profundamente envergonhado.","en":"I am deeply ashamed.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/494936","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"am","l":"estar"},null,{"g":"ashamed, shamefaced"}]},{"text":"Minha filha está dormindo profundamente.","en":"My daughter is fast asleep.","words":[{"g":"my, mine","l":"meu"},{"g":"daughter"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"dormir"},null]},{"text":"O bebê parecia estar dormindo profundamente.","en":"The baby seemed to be fast asleep.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"to seem","l":"parecer"},{"g":"to be"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"dormir"},null]},{"text":"Ele respirou profundamente.","en":"He breathed deeply.","words":[{"g":"he"},{"g":"to breathe","l":"respirar"},null]},{"text":"Tom está dormindo profundamente na cama.","en":"Tom is sound asleep in bed.","words":[{"g":"tone"},{"g":"is","l":"estar"},{"g":"to sleep","l":"dormir"},null,{"g":"in the"},{"g":"bed"}]}]}